- Use Mint Green for the fill.

#### [MODIFY] [src/components/game/StatBlock.jsx](file://[redacted-path])
- Update typography: Label in Sans-Serif, Value in Monospace.
- Clean up spacing.

### Pages

#### [MODIFY] [src/pages/Dashboard.jsx](file://[redacted-path])
